            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"id\":\"ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"4e9f804a-3dcc-4a36-b983-35e3f062d84e\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"Glow Korean Marine Collagen Peptides\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-11\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://wellbeingnutrition.com/products/glow-collagen-valencia-orange-flavour?variant=41372595257424\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0kiva4aj1jnggv9ugqs0i01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0kj7mjgp99ja95m0nkn0101\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"18nb9jj\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"form\":\"Powder\",\"brand\":\"Wellbeing Nutrition\",\"flavor\":\"Valencia Orange\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180666-be4d5f6f-0b1d-4b27-a853-2e5dcc2b3b9e.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180555-192efbe6-d2aa-4f1a-8c3e-f58af1c640e8.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180680-826f806c-3e3a-4d7c-a2f1-0b71b4e1f33c.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180532-03e95cfb-6435-4874-8436-e42986e19410.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180694-baf59b50-d684-4da8-84f1-076da6918a5f.jpg\"],\"weight\":\"250g\",\"benefits\":[\"Supports collagen production\",\"Helps promote even skin tone\",\"Helps reduce fine lines & wrinkles\",\"Helps improve skin radiance\",\"Helps reduce dark spots\",\"Helps repair skin barrier\"],\"shelfLife\":\"24 Months\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:wellness:collagen\",\"allergenInfo\":\"Non-Veg (sourced from deep-sea fish/salmon)\",\"certifications\":[\"Mercury Free\",\"Heavy Metal Tested\",\"Non-GMO\",\"No Artificial Colour or Flavour\",\"Clinically Validated\",\"Dermatologist Recommended\"],\"keyIngredients\":[\"Hydrolyzed Marine Collagen Peptide\",\"Liposomal L-Glutathione\",\"Vitamin C (L-Ascorbic Acid)\",\"Resveratrol\",\"DigeZyme (Alpha Amylase, Protease, Lipase, Cellulase, Lactase)\",\"Goji Berry Fruit Extract\"],\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":4,\"attributes\":{\"form\":[\"Powder\"],\"brand\":[\"Wellbeing Nutrition\"],\"flavor\":[\"Valencia Orange\"],\"weight\":[\"250g\"],\"shelfLife\":[\"24 Months\"],\"variantKey\":[\"Pack of 1\",\"Pack of 2\",\"Pack of 3\",\"Pack of 4\"],\"hasNSFWRisk\":[\"false\"],\"taxonomyTag\":[\"product:wellness:collagen\"],\"allergenInfo\":[\"Non-Veg (sourced from deep-sea fish/salmon)\"],\"variantLabel\":[\"Pack of 1\",\"Pack of 2\",\"Pack of 3\",\"Pack of 4\"],\"countryOfOrigin\":[\"India\"],\"usageDirections\":[\"Mix one level scoop (10g) in a 250ml glass of water, smoothie, juice, or breakfast bowl. Consume once daily for 12 weeks for best results.\"]}},\"countryOfOrigin\":\"India\",\"usageDirections\":\"Mix one level scoop (10g) in a 250ml glass of water, smoothie, juice, or breakfast bowl. Consume once daily for 12 weeks for best results.\",\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Desire / Identity\",\"reason\":\"The product primarily appeals to the customer's desire to achieve radiant, glowing skin and maintain a youthful, vibrant appearance associated with premium beauty standards.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Problem Solver\",\"reason\":\"It targets specific skincare pain points like fine lines, wrinkles, dark spots, uneven skin tone, and a damaged skin barrier.\"},{\"name\":\"Routine / Replenishment\",\"reason\":\"Designed for a daily ritual to be consumed once daily for at least 12 weeks, making it a perfect fit for a recurring wellness habit and multi-pack stocking.\"},{\"name\":\"Upgrade / Optimization\",\"reason\":\"It appeals to existing collagen users seeking a superior, premium formula enhanced with advanced ingredients like Liposomal Glutathione and clinical validation.\"}]},\"visual_description\":\"This product is a dietary supplement packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte white opaque plastic jar with a matching flat-topped, screw-on white cap featuring rounded upper edges. The jar features a wrap-around label with a smooth vertical color gradient transitioning from clean white at the top to a rich golden-yellow and warm orange at the bottom. Centered near the top is the \\\"Wellbeing Nutrition\\\" logo, consisting of a black stylized letter \\\"W\\\" with a tiny green leaf accent on its right peak, framed by arched black sans-serif text reading \\\"WELLBEING\\\" above and \\\"NUTRITION\\\" below. The central visual element is a large rectangular box with a golden-yellow background (which is a metallic bronze-gold on an alternate \\\"Piña Colada\\\" version) containing the lowercase, white serif typography \\\"glow collagen\\\" above the black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\". Below this, descriptive black text lists \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®\\\" (the Piña Colada version instead lists \\\"SkinAx2™, Glutathione\\\"), accented by a bolded \\\"Type I & III\\\" label and a distinct white horizontal banner displaying \\\"Valencia Orange Flavour\\\" (or \\\"Piña Colada Flavor\\\" on the older variant). To the right of this central box sits a circular gold emblem displaying a white, multi-faceted geometric sphere grid, bordered on the right by the curved black text \\\"Wild Caught • Mercury Free\\\", positioned below a small gold \\\"Clinically Approved\\\" cross badge and adjacent to bold black text reading \\\"8g Collagen per serving\\\". The bottom margin of the label features five simple black line-art icons representing \\\"Brightening\\\", \\\"Hydration\\\", \\\"Elasticity\\\", \\\"Anti-ageing\\\", and \\\"Protection\\\", flanked by weight specifications of \\\"Net Wt.: 250 g\\\" on the left and classification text on the right. When the fine, light-colored inner powder is mixed with water, it dissolves into a translucent, vibrant golden-orange liquid.\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"A premium marine collagen powder formulated with Liposomal Glutathione and Vitamin C in Valencia Orange flavor to boost skin radiance, hydration, and elasticity.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T11:19:01.534Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-16T11:20:27.972Z\",\"parentOffering\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"ddcb92f7-b9b8-4d10-91b4-920a01b3fdf7\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"4e9f804a-3dcc-4a36-b983-35e3f062d84e\",\"parentOfferingId\":\"ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1\",\"offeringType\":\"variant\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"Glow Korean Marine Collagen Peptides - Pack of 1\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-11-allergeninfo-non-veg-sourced-from-deep-sea-fish-salmon-brand-wellbeing-nutrition-countryoforigin-india-flavor-valencia-orange-form-powder-hasnsfwrisk-false-shelflife-24-months-taxonomytag-product-wellness-collagen-usagedirections-mix-one-level-scoop-10g-in-a-250ml-glass-of-water-smoothie-juice-or-breakfast-bowl-consume-once-daily-for-12-weeks-for-best-results-variantkey-pack-of-1-variantlabel-pack-of-1-weight-250g\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://wellbeingnutrition.com/products/glow-collagen-valencia-orange-flavour?variant=41372595257424\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":null,\"imageIngestionStatus\":null,\"visualDescriptionStatus\":null,\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":null,\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":null,\"variantKey\":\"allergenInfo=Non-Veg (sourced from deep-sea fish/salmon)|brand=Wellbeing Nutrition|countryOfOrigin=India|flavor=Valencia Orange|form=Powder|hasNSFWRisk=false|shelfLife=24 Months|taxonomyTag=product:wellness:collagen|u