sion) containing the lowercase, white serif typography \\\"glow collagen\\\" above the black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\". Below this, descriptive black text lists \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®\\\" (the Piña Colada version instead lists \\\"SkinAx2™, Glutathione\\\"), accented by a bolded \\\"Type I & III\\\" label and a distinct white horizontal banner displaying \\\"Valencia Orange Flavour\\\" (or \\\"Piña Colada Flavor\\\" on the older variant). To the right of this central box sits a circular gold emblem displaying a white, multi-faceted geometric sphere grid, bordered on the right by the curved black text \\\"Wild Caught • Mercury Free\\\", positioned below a small gold \\\"Clinically Approved\\\" cross badge and adjacent to bold black text reading \\\"8g Collagen per serving\\\". The bottom margin of the label features five simple black line-art icons representing \\\"Brightening\\\", \\\"Hydration\\\", \\\"Elasticity\\\", \\\"Anti-ageing\\\", and \\\"Protection\\\", flanked by weight specifications of \\\"Net Wt.: 250 g\\\" on the left and classification text on the right. When the fine, light-colored inner powder is mixed with water, it dissolves into a translucent, vibrant golden-orange liquid.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":null,\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180666-be4d5f6f-0b1d-4b27-a853-2e5dcc2b3b9e.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180555-192efbe6-d2aa-4f1a-8c3e-f58af1c640e8.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180680-826f806c-3e3a-4d7c-a2f1-0b71b4e1f33c.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180532-03e95cfb-6435-4874-8436-e42986e19410.jpg\"],\"visualDescription\":\"This product is a dietary supplement packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte white opaque plastic jar with a matching flat-topped, screw-on white cap featuring rounded upper edges. The jar features a wrap-around label with a smooth vertical color gradient transitioning from clean white at the top to a rich golden-yellow and warm orange at the bottom. Centered near the top is the \\\"Wellbeing Nutrition\\\" logo, consisting of a black stylized letter \\\"W\\\" with a tiny green leaf accent on its right peak, framed by arched black sans-serif text reading \\\"WELLBEING\\\" above and \\\"NUTRITION\\\" below. The central visual element is a large rectangular