pace under 15%. The single call to action is a clean pill-shaped tag reading \\\"learn more\\\" in soft sand beige (#F4EBE1). Brand alignment instructions: Keep the visual tone bright, airy, and clinical; use the natural wellness neutrals like sand beige (#F4EBE1) and warm orange accents to evoke premium, dermatologist-grade wellness without looking cluttered.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This product is a dietary supplement packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte white opaque plastic jar with a matching flat-topped, screw-on white cap featuring rounded upper edges. The jar features a wrap-around label with a smooth vertical color gradient transitioning from clean white at the top to a rich golden-yellow and warm orange at the bottom. Centered near the top is the \\\"Wellbeing Nutrition\\\" logo, consisting of a black stylized letter \\\"W\\\" with a tiny green leaf accent on its right peak, framed by arched black sans-serif text reading \\\"WELLBEING\\\" above and \\\"NUTRITION\\\" below. The central visual element is a large rectangular box with a golden-yellow background (which is a metallic bronze-gold on an alternate \\\"Piña Colada\\\" version) containing the lowercase, white serif typography \\\"glow collagen\\\" above the black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\". Below this, descriptive black text lists \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®\\\" (the Piña Colada version instead lists \\\"SkinAx2™, Glutathione\\\"), accented by a bolded \\\"Type I & III\\\" label and a distinct white horizontal banner displaying \\\"Valencia Orange Flavour\\\" (or \\\"Piña Colada Flavor\\\" on the older variant). To the right of this central box sits a circular gold emblem displaying a white, multi-faceted geometric sphere grid, bordered on the right by the curved black text \\\"Wild Caught • Mercury Free\\\", positioned below a small gold \\\"Clinically Approved\\\" cross badge and adjacent to bold black text reading \\