.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":null,\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180666-be4d5f6f-0b1d-4b27-a853-2e5dcc2b3b9e.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180555-192efbe6-d2aa-4f1a-8c3e-f58af1c640e8.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180680-826f806c-3e3a-4d7c-a2f1-0b71b4e1f33c.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180532-03e95cfb-6435-4874-8436-e42986e19410.jpg\"],\"visualDescription\":\"This product is a dietary supplement packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte white opaque plastic jar with a matching flat-topped, screw-on white cap featuring rounded upper edges. The jar features a wrap-around label with a smooth vertical color gradient transitioning from clean white at the top to a rich golden-yellow and warm orange at the bottom. Centered near the top is the \\\"Wellbeing Nutrition\\\" logo, consisting of a black stylized letter \\\"W\\\" with a tiny green leaf accent on its right peak, framed by arched black sans-serif text reading \\\"WELLBEING\\\" above and \\\"NUTRITION\\\" below. The central visual element is a large rectangular box with a golden-yellow background (which is a metallic bronze-gold on an alternate \\\"Piña Colada\\\" version) containing the lowercase, white serif typography \\\"glow collagen\\\" above the black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\". Below this, descriptive black text lists \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®\\\" (the Piña Co