being Nutrition jar sits tucked in the bottom corner of the colorful circle to introduce the solution naturally. The single call to action is a sharp-edged, flat-rectangular orange button in primary brand orange (#ff5000) that reads \\\"see how it works.\\\" Brand alignment instructions: Rely on high contrast between the muted mist-gray background (#f2f4f7) and the energetic brand orange (#ff5000); keep the copy minimal and leverage the stark, graphic split to emphasize the immediate shift from dullness to skin hydration.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This product is a dietary supplement packaged in a wide, cylindrical, matte white opaque plastic jar with a matching flat-topped, screw-on white cap featuring rounded upper edges. The jar features a wrap-around label with a smooth vertical color gradient transitioning from clean white at the top to a rich golden-yellow and warm orange at the bottom. Centered near the top is the \\\"Wellbeing Nutrition\\\" logo, consisting of a black stylized letter \\\"W\\\" with a tiny green leaf accent on its right peak, framed by arched black sans-serif text reading \\\"WELLBEING\\\" above and \\\"NUTRITION\\\" below. The central visual element is a large rectangular box with a golden-yellow background (which is a metallic bronze-gold on an alternate \\\"Piña Colada\\\" version) containing the lowercase, white serif typography \\\"glow collagen\\\" above the black Korean characters \\\"글로우 콜라겐\\\". Below this, descriptive black text lists \\\"Korean Marine Collagen Peptides with Liposomal Glutathione, Vitamin C, Resveratrol and DigeZyme®\\\" (the Piña Colada version instead lists \\\"SkinAx2™, Glutathione\\\"), accented by a bolded \\\"Type I & III\\\" label and a distinct white horizontal banner displaying \\\"Valencia Orange Flavour\\\" (or \\\"Piña Colada Flavor\\\" on the older variant). To the right of this central box sits a circular gold emblem displaying a white, multi-faceted geometric sphere grid, bordered on the right by the c