of the label features five simple black line-art icons representing \\\"Brightening\\\", \\\"Hydration\\\", \\\"Elasticity\\\", \\\"Anti-ageing\\\", and \\\"Protection\\\", flanked by weight specifications of \\\"Net Wt.: 250 g\\\" on the left and classification text on the right. When the fine, light-colored inner powder is mixed with water, it dissolves into a translucent, vibrant golden-orange liquid.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180666-be4d5f6f-0b1d-4b27-a853-2e5dcc2b3b9e.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180555-192efbe6-d2aa-4f1a-8c3e-f58af1c640e8.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180680-826f806c-3e3a-4d7c-a2f1-0b71b4e1f33c.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180532-03e95cfb-6435-4874-8436-e42986e19410.jpg\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180666-be4d5f6f-0b1d-4b27-a853-2e5dcc2b3b9e.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180555-192efbe6-d2aa-4f1a-8c3e-f58af1c640e8.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180680-826f806c-3e3a-4d7c-a2f1-0b71b4e1f33c.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/ddfde795-8c45-44bd-8f63-1853a51a88a1/1786879180532-03e95cfb-6435-4874-8436-e42986e19410.jpg\"]},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T11:21:58.547Z\"}]},\"displayVariation\":{\"id\":\"1d26dc9a-b855-41cd-99b1-ad7150302840\",\"creativeVersionId\":\"cf8ec75b-554f-44ce-a0d9-3b620f829290\",\"variationType\":\"size\",\"variationKey\":\"original\",\"width\":null,\"height\":null,\"aspectRatio\":null,\"platform\":null,\"isPrimary\":true,\"storageKey\":null,\"assetUrl\":n